# R8 keep rules — :network
#
# Our own wire models need no rules here: the classes Gson reflects over carry
# @androidx.annotation.Keep and @SerializedName, and the mapping for that annotation
# is declared once in :app's keep rules. Gson ships its own consumer rules
# (META-INF/proguard/gson.pro) for TypeToken subclasses and the Signature attribute.

# --- Tor (JNI) ------------------------------------------------------------------
# libtor.so loads through TorService, and the native layer calls back into these
# types by name, which R8 cannot see. The library ships no consumer rules of its
# own, so the package is pinned wholesale.
-keep class org.torproject.jni.** { *; }
